---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free Intake Review for Law Firms Under $250K | Attorney Assistant"
  description="Your firm doesn't need more chaos. It needs intake that actually gets handled. Book a free intake review and see where leads are slipping through."
  noindex={true}
>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="smb-orb smb-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="smb-orb smb-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="smb-pulse-badge">
              <span class="smb-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            Your Firm Doesn't Need More Chaos. <br/><span class="text-gradient-gold">It Needs Intake That Gets Handled.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Missed calls. Slow follow-up. Weak intake. Leads that disappear before they ever become signed cases.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Attorney Assistant helps law firms build the team, coverage, and systems needed to stop wasting the opportunities they already have.
          </p>

          <!-- What we'll cover on the review -->
          <div class="space-y-3 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Free Review We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/8 hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Where leads are slipping through</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">We'll map your intake process and find the gaps.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/8 hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">How fast your firm actually responds</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Real numbers from our secret shop, not guesswork.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/8 hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What it's costing you per month</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">We'll quantify the revenue you're leaving on the table.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/8 hover:border-brand-gold/20 transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What to fix first &mdash; without replacing your team</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Actionable steps you can take this week.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; no commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Includes free secret shop
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal smb-widget-glow md:mt-12 scroll-mt-20" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Free Intake Review</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes &mdash; includes secret shop</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/review?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 smb-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full smb-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       THE LEAK — Before you spend more on marketing
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 smb-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border-red-500/20 mb-6">Before You Spend More</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            Before You Spend More on Marketing, <span class="text-gradient-gold">Fix the Leak.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Most small law firms don't lose money because they lack ambition. They lose money because the firm is still depending on the owner to check everything, chase everyone, answer after-hours gaps, follow up with leads, and somehow run the business too.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            When leads come in and no one responds fast enough, they move on. When follow-up is inconsistent, cases go cold. When intake is messy, marketing dollars get wasted.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            Attorney Assistant helps you clean that up.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated phone scenario -->
        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="smb-phone-sim">
            <div class="smb-phone-header">
              <div class="smb-phone-header-left">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 3.5A1.5 1.5 0 013.5 2h1.148a1.5 1.5 0 011.465 1.175l.716 3.223a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.052 1.767l-.933.267c-.694.198-.983 1.03-.503 1.576a12.07 12.07 0 005.147 3.834c.595.23 1.26-.092 1.392-.719l.236-1.12a1.5 1.5 0 011.667-1.172l3.361.56A1.5 1.5 0 0116 12.69v1.81A1.5 1.5 0 0114.5 16h-.628a12.565 12.565 0 01-11.757-8.142A12.49 12.49 0 012 3.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span>What Happens When Someone Calls</span>
              </div>
              <div class="smb-phone-status">
                <span class="smb-phone-status-dot"></span>
                Simulated
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="smb-phone-body">
              <div class="smb-phone-event smb-phone-event--ring">
                <div class="smb-phone-time">9:14 AM</div>
                <div class="smb-phone-msg">
                  <div class="smb-phone-msg-row">
                    <span class="smb-phone-msg-title">Incoming Call &mdash; New Lead</span>
                    <span class="smb-phone-badge smb-phone-badge--ring">Ringing</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="smb-phone-msg-desc">Car accident. Needs representation. Found you on Google.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="smb-phone-event smb-phone-event--miss">
                <div class="smb-phone-time">9:14 AM</div>
                <div class="smb-phone-msg">
                  <div class="smb-phone-msg-row">
                    <span class="smb-phone-msg-title">Call Missed</span>
                    <span class="smb-phone-badge smb-phone-badge--miss">Voicemail</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="smb-phone-msg-desc">Team was on the other line. No overflow coverage.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="smb-phone-event smb-phone-event--gone">
                <div class="smb-phone-time">9:15 AM</div>
                <div class="smb-phone-msg">
                  <div class="smb-phone-msg-row">
                    <span class="smb-phone-msg-title">Lead Called Next Firm</span>
                    <span class="smb-phone-badge smb-phone-badge--gone">Lost</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="smb-phone-msg-desc">Signed with a competitor 12 minutes later. You'll never know they called.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="smb-phone-footer">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182" /></svg>
              <span>This happens multiple times per week at most firms.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       THE SILENT COST — animated stat counters + storytelling
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white smb-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-6 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 border border-red-500/20 mb-6">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          The Numbers
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          This isn't a marketing problem. It's a conversion problem happening inside your firm.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Big animated stats -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg font-heading text-brand-gold mb-2"><span class="smb-count" data-target="78">0</span>%</div>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-600">of PI leads hire the first firm that responds</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg font-heading text-red-500 mb-2">~<span class="smb-count" data-target="5">0</span> min</div>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-600">is all you have before a lead goes cold</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg font-heading text-brand-gold mb-2"><span class="smb-count" data-target="40">0</span>%</div>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-600">of calls to law firms go completely unanswered</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Scrolling story beats -->
      <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <div class="smb-story-beat reveal">
          <div class="smb-story-line"></div>
          <div class="smb-story-dot smb-story-dot--red"></div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-10">
            A call comes in. No one answers. They call the next firm.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-story-beat reveal">
          <div class="smb-story-line"></div>
          <div class="smb-story-dot smb-story-dot--amber"></div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-10">
            A lead fills out a form. Follow-up happens hours later. Too late.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-story-beat reveal">
          <div class="smb-story-line"></div>
          <div class="smb-story-dot smb-story-dot--red"></div>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-10">
            A message comes in after hours. No one sees it until morning. They're gone.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-story-beat reveal">
          <div class="smb-story-line" style="display:none;"></div>
          <div class="smb-story-dot smb-story-dot--big"></div>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-900 font-heading leading-snug pl-10">
            No alert. No warning. Just missed opportunities you never even see.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       SECRET SHOP — interactive reveal
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950 smb-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/5 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 12.5a2.5 2.5 0 100-5 2.5 2.5 0 000 5z" /><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M.664 10.59a1.651 1.651 0 010-1.186A10.004 10.004 0 0110 3c4.257 0 7.893 2.66 9.336 6.41.147.381.146.804 0 1.186A10.004 10.004 0 0110 17c-4.257 0-7.893-2.66-9.336-6.41zM14 10a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
          Included Free With Your Review
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-4">
          We'll Secret Shop <span class="text-gradient-gold">Your Firm.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">After your call, we'll have a specialist pose as a prospective client and pressure-test your intake. Then we'll show you what really happened.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 mb-12">
        <div class="smb-shop-step reveal">
          <div class="smb-shop-num">1</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">We call your firm</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">Business hours, after hours, and weekends.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-shop-step reveal" style="transition-delay:100ms">
          <div class="smb-shop-num">2</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">We submit a web lead</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">And time how long until someone responds.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-shop-step reveal" style="transition-delay:200ms">
          <div class="smb-shop-num">3</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">We document everything</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">Response time, tone, follow-up cadence, gaps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="smb-shop-step reveal" style="transition-delay:300ms">
          <div class="smb-shop-num">4</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">We walk you through it</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">On your review call. No sugar-coating.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <div class="relative bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center backdrop-blur-sm">
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 italic">"Most firms are shocked by what they find. And that's exactly why it's valuable."</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary group inline-flex">
              Book Your Free Review + Secret Shop
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHAT WE DO — interactive before/after
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white smb-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">What Changes</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          We own the outcome, not just the task.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We're not here to toss another tool at your firm and wish you luck. We help build the structure behind the work.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Before / After comparison -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="smb-compare smb-compare--before">
            <div class="smb-compare-header smb-compare-header--before">
              <span class="smb-compare-badge smb-compare-badge--before">Before</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-red-400">Without structure</span>
            </div>
            <div class="smb-compare-body">
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> Calls go to voicemail</div>
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> Leads wait hours for a response</div>
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> Follow-up stops after one try</div>
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> After-hours &mdash; nobody home</div>
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> You check everything yourself</div>
              <div class="smb-compare-item"><span class="smb-compare-x">&#10005;</span> Cases slip through the cracks</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay:150ms">
          <div class="smb-compare smb-compare--after">
            <div class="smb-compare-header smb-compare-header--after">
              <span class="smb-compare-badge smb-compare-badge--after">After</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400">With Attorney Assistant</span>
            </div>
            <div class="smb-compare-body">
